stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Working
  Working --> Attention: Work needs review
  Working --> Done: Processing completes
  Attention --> SetAside: Hide from inbox
  Attention --> Snoozed: Snooze
  Attention --> AutoSettled: Canonical work resolves
  Attention --> AutoSettled: Mark task done
  Done --> SetAside: Hide completed update
  Snoozed --> Attention: Wake
  Snoozed --> AutoSettled: Snooze expires after resolution
  SetAside --> Undone: Undo hide
  AutoSettled --> Undone: Show in inbox
  AutoSettled --> Attention: Undo task completion
  Undone --> Snoozed: Snooze again
  Undone --> SetAside: Hide again
  Undone --> Attention: Canonical work reopens
  state "Dr. CRE is working" as Working
  state "Needs your attention" as Attention
  state "Done update" as Done
  state "Set aside by you" as SetAside
  state "Snoozed until chosen time" as Snoozed
  state "Settled by what happened" as AutoSettled
  state "Returned to inbox by you" as Undone
